        "id": 1883512
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-13T07:24:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with you. Ideally, this logic should not be present within an `#ifdef` conditional statement.\n\nOne potential solution would be to create a new c file, encapsulating all of the logic and providing hooks to invoke the functions. However, based on my understanding, this approach may introduce additional complexity and require a significant investment of time.\n\nIn any case, as indicated in b/120441124#comment29,\nwe plan to propose these changes to upstream. I welcome your thoughts and insights on this matter.",
